      },
      "width": 650,
      "height": 300,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "event-handler-smoke"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Event Handler and Method smoke test\n\n1. Enter edit mode and edit **Demo label**.\n2. Change its value and Apply.\n3. Verify **Update rendered label** reports a successful delivery.\n4. Verify **Write label into rendered result** reports a successful call.\n5. Verify **Rendered result** changes immediately.\n\nThe Event Handler contains no code. It binds `Demo label · property.changed` to the Method that owns the reaction."
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail"
        }
      }
    },
